Subject: [PATCH] Offer device download when saving an unchanged cached file

Desktop Save intentionally skips unmodified documents. In the browser,
the user may still need the existing saved bytes on their device. Reuse
the normal save preflight so pending image work completes before deciding
whether the document is unchanged. Save As and recovery keep their native
paths; no document serialization or cache rewrite is needed for this copy.

diff --git a/libs/ui/KisMainWindow.cpp b/libs/ui/KisMainWindow.cpp
--- a/libs/ui/KisMainWindow.cpp
+++ b/libs/ui/KisMainWindow.cpp
@@ -1552,6 +1552,12 @@
         if (document->isModified()) {
             ret = document->save(true, 0);
         }
+#ifdef Q_OS_WASM
+        else {
+            extern bool kritaWasmOfferUnmodifiedDownload(KisDocument *);
+            ret = kritaWasmOfferUnmodifiedDownload(document);
+        }
+#endif
 
         if (!ret) {
             dbgUI << "Failed Save!";
